    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 10 Hillsbrook Drive, a bright and generously proportioned three-bedroom semi-detached family home, lovingly maintained by its original owners since its construction. Set on a generous site, this substantial property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable family home with further potential to enhance and extend. The property benefits from a large front garden with ample off-street parking, a garage with excellent potential for conversion (subject to the necessary p.p), and a beautifully landscaped rear garden providing a private and peaceful outdoor space. Internally, the well-proportioned accommodation at ground level comprises an entrance porch, welcoming hallway, spacious living room, dining room and an extended kitchen, as well as a lean-to utility area and garage. Upstairs, there are three spacious bedrooms and a large family bathroom.\n\nThe location is undoubtedly one of the property's most appealing features, with Hillsbrook Drive being one of Perrystown's most established and sought-after residential addresses. A host of local amenities are within easy reach, including neighbourhood shops, bars and restaurants, Ashleaf Shopping Centre and Carlisle Fitness Centre, while the M50 motorway is also conveniently accessible, connecting all major national routes. The nearby villages of Terenure, Walkinstown and Templeogue offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities, while the area is well served by an array of parks and green spaces, ideal for families and outdoor enthusiasts.\n\nThere is an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area, further enhancing the property's appeal as a family home. Public transport is also very well catered for, with various Dublin Bus routes within walking distance, providing convenient access to the city centre and surrounding areas. Combining generous accommodation, excellent potential and a superb location, 10 Hillsbrook Drive represents an exciting opportunity for a new owner to create a wonderful long-term family home. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nKitchen - \n5.63 m × 3.20 m max\n\nDining Room - \n3.34 m × 4.19 m\n\nSitting Room - \n3.56 m × 4.38 m\n\nUtility Room - \n3.76 m × 1.44 m\n\nGarage - \n6.15 m × 2.45 m\n\nStore - \n2.10 m × 0.86 m\n\nEntrance Hall - \n3.85 m × 2.20 m\n\nBedroom 1 - \n3.56 m × 4.11 m max\n\nBedroom 2 - \n3.34 m × 4.18 m\n\nBedroom 3 - \n2.86 m max × 2.30 m\n\nBathroom - \n1.72 m × 2.19 m\n\nLanding - \n2.60 m × 2.19 m\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Immaculately presented, extended 3 bed semi-detached family home</li><li> 126 sqm./ 1,356 sq.ft. inc. garage</li><li> Garage to the side, offering superb further conversion/ extension potential</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> Modern double-glazed windows</li><li> Wonderfully maintained by its original owners since construction in the late 1950's</li><li> Great, family friendly local community with an abundance of recreational facilities</li><li> Every possible amenity on its doorstep</li><li> Excellent primary and secondary school options in the area</li><li> Various bus routes to the city centre</li><li> Nearby M50 road network with access to all major national routes.</ul>"
